PXA Pinyin IME Lite

The immutable character mapping and shared T9 implementation are derived from
lvgl_pinyin_ime by VanillaNahida and contributors (Apache License, Version 2.0):
https://github.com/VanillaNahida/lvgl_pinyin_ime
Revision: 037169998150a768ff43863fc44d563222d4b801

Only single GB2312 Han characters and their spellings are retained. Candidates
are ordered by the source frequency. No statistical decoder or word/sentence
model is included. The source SHA256 and generation procedure are recorded in
data/pinyin.tsv and tools/generate_table.py. Original T9 notices are retained in
../pinyin-ime/core and ../pinyin-ime/generated. See LICENSE.
